/# locals: (profile:)
header class="fixed inset-x-0 top-0 z-40 border-b border-rule-soft bg-ink/95 backdrop-blur-sm"
  nav class="mx-auto flex max-w-5xl items-center justify-between gap-6 px-6 py-3.5" aria-label="Primary"
    a class="flex items-center gap-2.5 font-mono text-sm text-fg" href="#top"
      / Status square, not a pulsing dot. It sits still.
      span class="h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 bg-amber" aria-hidden="true"
      = profile.name.downcase
    ul class="hidden items-center gap-7 font-mono text-sm text-dim md:flex"
      li
        a class="transition-colors hover:text-fg" href="#impact" impact
      li
        a class="transition-colors hover:text-fg" href="#work" work
      li
        a class="transition-colors hover:text-fg" href="#projects" projects
      li
        a class="transition-colors hover:text-fg" href="#skills" skills
    button class="flex shrink-0 items-center gap-2.5 border border-rule px-3 py-1.5 font-mono text-xs text-dim transition-colors hover:border-amber hover:text-fg" type="button" data-action="click->palette#open" aria-label="Open the command palette"
      | jump
      kbd class="hidden font-mono text-fg sm:inline" ⌘K
